        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Adams Rite 4016 Header Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAdding the 4016 Header Bolt to a pivoted bolt MS® deadlock provides Maximum Security for pairs of doors with the turn of a single key. Simultaneously extending the stainless steel hexbolts into the header and pivoting the massive MS bolt into the mating door’s stile, the two-point locking solution secures the entire entrance. This is an Adams Rite 4016 Header Bolt for <a href=\"/products/ansi-ms-series-deadlock-adams-rite-ms1850sn-410\"><b>MS1850S Series Mortise Boxes</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the Adams Rite 4016 Header Bolt for 7 Foot Doors:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Height: 7'</li>\r\n<li>Header Bolt: Hexagonal 3/8\" [9.5 mm] flat to flat. Made of stainless steel.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually</i>\r\n</p>",
